=== CREATE EVENT — 1064 parse-reject ===
CREATE EVENT e ON SCHEDULE EVERY 1 HOUR DO SELECT 1;
ERROR 1064: SQL parse error: sql parser error: Expected: an object type after CREATE, found: EVENT at Line: 1, Column: 8
